---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
const guide = {
  "title": "Australia Visitor Visa 600 from Pakistan: Preparation",
  "description": "Find the relevant Australian visitor stream, current fee estimator and official processing information, then prepare evidence for your circumstances.",
  "intro": "Find the relevant Australian visitor stream, current fee estimator and official processing information, then prepare evidence for your circumstances.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Home Affairs overseas Tourist stream",
      "url": "https://immi.homeaffairs.gov.au/visas/getting-a-visa/visa-listing/visitor-600/tourist-stream-overseas"
    },
    {
      "title": "Official pricing estimator",
      "url": "https://immi.homeaffairs.gov.au/visas/visa-pricing-estimator"
    },
    {
      "title": "Official processing guide",
      "url": "https://immi.homeaffairs.gov.au/visas/getting-a-visa/visa-processing-times/global-visa-processing-times"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Choose the stream",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The overseas Tourist stream covers holidays and family/friend visits. Business and sponsored-family streams have separate conditions. Check location requirements at application and decision. A Visitor visa does not provide ordinary work permission."
      ],
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Explain the temporary visit",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Build a concise itinerary and budget. Explain accommodation, payer, host relationship where relevant, and circumstances supporting a temporary visit. Follow the application’s evidence list rather than a universal Pakistan checklist.",
        "Use ImmiAccount’s actual upload instructions. If asked for health checks, biometrics or documents, use the deadline in the request; do not assume every case has the same 14-day deadline."
      ],
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Check the current charge",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Use the official estimator for subclass, stream and circumstances. Keep medical, translation and service expenses separate. The earlier fixed AUD amount is not retained as a current quote. Save the payment receipt and application reference."
      ],
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Allow for processing",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The official guide describes recent processing outcomes rather than a guaranteed new-application deadline. Monitor the authorised account and respond to requests. Submission does not mean a requested travel date has been accepted."
      ],
      "source": 2
    },
    {
      "heading": "Check the grant conditions",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Read entry deadline, stay period, entries and conditions in the grant. Do not assume a No Further Stay condition applies to most Pakistani applicants without evidence. If a condition affects a later application or extension, consult Home Affairs or a qualified adviser before making commitments."
      ],
      "source": 0
    }
  ]
};
---
<GuideLayout {...guide} />
